  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is that to strengthen the capacity of the NCCC  to fullfill its mandate to address CC and to enable government        ministries and CSOs to implement priority CC actions. The prog.aims   at creating conditions in the form of capacity building&amp;institutional strengthening to preparing for and mitigating CC risks, and it aims   also to directly help vulnerable communities to more CC resilience.</narrative>
